{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "A Quiet Night at Home", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Staying In", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 13, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Exchanging Opinions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you exchange opinions, you give your ideas on a topic. Usually the person you are talking to responds to your opinion.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use many different phrases to exchange opinions. It's a good idea to use a variety of phrases, to keep the conversation interesting.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Giving an Opinion</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Responding to an Opinion</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's quite obvious ... <br/>I honestly feel ... <br/>... I think. <br/>It seems to me that ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I know what you mean. <br/>Me too. <br/>Yes, I suppose so. <br/>You took the words right out of my mouth!\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Anna</span>: <span class=\"strong\">It's quite obvious</span> that working is not like college.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: <span class=\"strong\">I know what you mean.</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Anna</span>: <span class=\"strong\">I honestly feel</span> I need to be entertained!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: <span class=\"strong\">Me too.</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Anna</span>: We need something that takes our minds off work, <span class=\"strong\">I think</span>.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: <span class=\"strong\">Yes, I suppose so.</span>", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Subject and Object Relative Clauses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<p>When you want to clarify which person or thing you are talking about, you use a <span class=\"strong\">relative clause</span>.</p><p>You can begin a <span class=\"strong\">relative clause</span> with <span class=\"italic\">who</span> for people, <span class=\"italic\">which</span> for things or <span class=\"italic\">that</span> for either people or things.</p>You put the <span class=\"strong\">relative clause </span> immediately after the noun it talks about.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "A <span class=\"strong\">subject relative clause </span> describes the subject of the clause.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">The woman <span class=\"strong\">who</span>/<span class=\"strong\">that</span> lives next door brought me a cake.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The clause - <span class=\"italic\">who</span>/<span class=\"italic\">that</span> lives next door - refers to the woman. <span class=\"italic\">Who</span>/<span class=\"italic\">that</span> is the relative pronoun. It is also the subject of the clause. Who lives next door? The woman", "type": "text"}, {"content": "An <span class=\"strong\">object relative clause</span> describes the object of the clause.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">The apartment <span class=\"strong\">which</span>/<span class=\"strong\">that</span> we rented was near the center of the city.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The clause - <span class=\"italic\">which</span>/<span class=\"italic\">that</span> we rented - refers to the apartment.  <span class=\"italic\">Which</span>/<span class=\"italic\">that</span> is the relative pronoun. <span class=\"italic\">We</span> is the subject of the clause. <span class=\"italic\">Apartment</span> is the object of the clause. What did we rent? The apartment.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Subject Relative Clause</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Object Relative Clause</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"This is the first day <span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">that</span> we've had together in a while.</span><br/>(What have we had together? The day.)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I brought along a couple of movies <span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">that</span> are supposed to be quite entertaining</span>!<br/>(What is entertaining? The movies.)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"This movie has that actor <span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">who</span> won an Oscar last year</span>.<br/>(Who won the Oscar? That actor.)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He did that series <span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">that</span> we liked in college</span>.<br/>(What did we like in college? That series.)\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "spare", "type": "name"}, {"content": "extra", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I don't have a lot of spare time to do leisure activities.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk with friends.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "inspiration", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person or thing that prompts action", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I look for inspiration for my articles online.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "moratorium", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a suspension; stopping", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have declared a moratorium on spending so I can save some money.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to put away", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to save", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to put away enough money to go to India.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "rest and relaxation", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a period without work", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Rest and relaxation are just what I need after doing all that overtime!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to bring along", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to carry with", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I brought a couple of movies along in case you wanted to watch something.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to pass up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to say no to", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I would never pass up a free holiday!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write a paragraph about an activity that you did using -ed and -ing adjectives.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say where you were, what happened, who you were with and how you felt.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Clarify which people or things you are referring to using who, which or that.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your paragraph to someone.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I clarify which people or things I am referring to.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about my feelings and the situation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give a full explanation of who, where, what and with whom this happened.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my paragraph with someone.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le13ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le13ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: This is the first day that we've had together in a while.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's quite obvious that working is not like college. I feel tired a lot. It's depressing. I don't get to the movies. I spend my spare time on the Internet, looking for inspiration!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I know what you mean. I've declared a moratorium on shopping. I want to put away some money for a trip."}, {"image": "engenn7le13ob02re2img02.jpg", "time": "22000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Today is all rest and relaxation! I brought along a couple of movies that are supposed to be quite entertaining!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, I honestly feel I need to be entertained! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Me too. I passed up anything that looked like a tearjerker. We need something that makes us take our minds off work, I think."}, {"image": "engenn7le13ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "40000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, I suppose so. No terrifying horror or boring action films, thank goodness! This movie has that actor who won an Oscar last year.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: This one has the director who did that interesting series that we liked in college.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It seems to me that we should put our feet up and start watching!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You took the words right out of my mouth!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le13ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le13ob02re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about movies and social activities.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express complex statements using words like <span class=\"italic\">who</span>, <span class=\"italic\">that</span> or <span class=\"italic\">which</span>.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can exchange opinions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What things do you do to relax after a long week at work or at school?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What do you think is the best way to unwind?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Ah! It's time to relax!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "id"